      "widgets_values": [
        "Original character in a cinematic scene."
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "A single cinematic frame from an original, beautifully crafted stylized 3D animated family film. Medium shot at the child's eye level on a sunny beach. Maxi, one androgynous eight-year-old child, has a soft brown bob haircut, large blue eyes behind round amber glasses, a mustard yellow T-shirt under teal short overalls. Maxi kneels beside a small handmade sandcastle and carefully steadies a low sand arch with both hands. Their expression is concentrated and slightly unsure, with a small hopeful smile. The castle and hands are clearly visible in the foreground. A little turquoise bucket sits nearby. Warm late-afternoon sunlight, softly glowing rim light on brown hair, tactile fabric and fine sand grains, appealing rounded character design, expressive face, gentle depth of field, blue ocean softly blurred behind. Wide 16:9 film composition, one continuous image, no lettering, no collage."
      }
